message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "scpark-network: Analysis pipeline for science-park proximity and academic co-authorship networks"
abstract: >-
  Full analysis pipeline for a study of pseudo-replication in affiliation-string
  co-authorship networks: bibliometric extraction from OpenAlex, geocoding,
  micro-geographic science-park classification against a Wikidata ground truth,
  construction of naive and entity-resolved co-affiliation networks, the
  hyperauthorship (institution-count cap and fractional-counting) analyses, and
  the fourteen-item reporting protocol with its robustness, permutation,
  equivalence and power analyses. Accompanies the Short Communication
  "Pseudo-replication and composite degree in affiliation-string co-authorship networks: node identity manufactures certainty, hyperauthorship carries much of the effect" (Hung-Chi Chang,
  submitted to the Journal of Informetrics, September 2026).
type: software
